## Definitions

- **"Software"** means the AresRPG source code and associated files made available under this license
  in the canonical public repository, including covered portions of modified or derivative works.
- **"Smart Contracts"** means the AresRPG-authored code intended for execution on a blockchain,
  including the contract packages identified by `move-packages.json`, their bytecode, and their
  blockchain-deployable derivatives. Separately licensed third-party contracts are not relicensed
  by this definition.
- **"Canonical Deployment"** means the official AresRPG blockchain deployment identified by the
  network, package identities, and shared-object references in the Licensor-published `pins.json`
  for the corresponding AresRPG release, including upgrades or successors expressly designated by
  the Licensor. The canonical repository is `https://github.com/aresrpg/aresrpg`. Your own copy,
  edited manifest, new package, or new registry cannot designate a Canonical Deployment.
- **"Licensor"** means **Sceat**.
- **"You"** means the individual or entity exercising rights granted by this license.
- **"Contribution"** means an original work of authorship, including a modification or addition to
  the Software, intentionally submitted to the Licensor for inclusion in the Software.

